## 二、AppNavHost.kt（路由表）

### 建议文件：`code/MyFirstApp/app/src/main/java/com/example/myfirstapp/ui/AppNavHost.kt`

```kotlin
package com.example.myfirstapp.ui

import androidx.compose.runtime.Composable
import androidx.navigation.NavType
import androidx.navigation.compose.NavHost
import androidx.navigation.compose.composable
import androidx.navigation.compose.rememberNavController
import androidx.navigation.navArgument

@Composable
fun AppNavHost(repoProvider: () -> com.example.myfirstapp.data.NoteRepository) {
    val navController = rememberNavController()

    NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = "list") {
        composable("list") {
            NoteListScreen(
                repo = repoProvider(),
                onAddNote = { navController.navigate("edit") },                    // 新建
                onOpenNote = { id -> navController.navigate("edit/$id") },        // 编辑
            )
        }
        composable(
            route = "edit/{noteId}",
            arguments = listOf(navArgument("noteId") { type = NavType.IntType }),
        ) { entry ->
            val noteId = entry.arguments?.getInt("noteId") ?: 0
            NoteEditScreen(
                repo = repoProvider(),
                noteId = noteId,
                onDone = { navController.popBackStack() },      // 返回列表
            )
        }
    }
}
```

**逐段解读**：
- `rememberNavController()`：导航控制器（Day 8 说的"App 内页面跳转全靠它"）
- `NavHost`：路由表容器，`startDestination` 指定起始页
- `navigate("edit/$id")`：字符串模板拼路由（参数在 URL 里，像前端）
- `popBackStack()`：出栈返回（返回键同效）
- 路由参数要声明 `navArgument` 类型，取的时候 `entry.arguments?.getInt` —— 空安全又一次实战

`MainActivity.kt` 变成纯宿主：
```kotlin
setContent {
    AppNavHost(repoProvider = { (application as QuickNoteApp).container.noteRepository })
}
```

